# Stats on a number line: one outlier drags the mean.
title "Where does the mean sit?"
schema numberline prop=score

mark ana dot student score=62
mark ben dot student score=70
mark cy  dot student score=74
mark dee dot student score=78
mark eve dot student score=72
mark avg label score={mean(score)} label="mean"

Say: "Five students, all scoring in the sixties and seventies."
focus avg
Say: "The mean sits at seventy one."
focus eve
Say: "Now suppose Eve |drop| had a terrible day."
@drop morph eve.score 72 -> 20 3s
focus avg
Say: "One outlier pulls the mean all the way down to sixty one."
focus none
